    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prolog">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> Prolog</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eadmund cyning cyð eallum folce, ge yldrum ge gingrum, ðe on his anwealde syn, ðæt ic smeade mid minra witena geðeahte, ge god[cund]ra hada ge læwedra, ærest, hu ic mæhte Cristendomes mest aræran.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">I, King Edmund, inform all people, both high and low, who are under my authority, that I have been considering, with the advice of my councillors both ecclesiastical and lay, first of all how I could best promote Christianity.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eadmund cyning cyð eallum folce, ge yldrum ge gingrum, ðe on his anwealde synd, ðæt ic smeade mid minra witena geðeahte, ge hadreda ge læwedra, ærest, hu ic mæhte Cristendomes mæst aræran.</ab>
      </div>
